=== D1-66: 遥测开关与端点环境变量 ===
Date: 2026-09-20
Environment: Windows, Node.js v24.14.1, huaweicloud-devkit@1.1.5

Source: telemetry/telemetry.mjs - isTelemetryEnabled, getEndpoint

Test results:
  TELEMETRY=off    → isTelemetryEnabled(): false ✓
  TELEMETRY unset  → isTelemetryEnabled(): true  ✓ (default enabled)
  TELEMETRY=on     → isTelemetryEnabled(): true  ✓

  Custom ENDPOINT set (https://custom.example.com/telemetry) → getEndpoint returns custom ✓
  ENDPOINT unset → getEndpoint returns default (https://devkit.huaweicloud.com/rest/developer/server/hdkitservice/telemetry/events) ✓

VERDICT: PASS
Telemetry is enabled by default; HUAWEICLOUD_DEVKIT_TELEMETRY=off disables it.
Custom endpoint can be set via HUAWEICLOUD_DEVKIT_TELEMETRY_ENDPOINT.
